# Test dependencies of the Python package for the CI version matrix
# (Python 3.10-3.13): the wheel is built once per OS by the "Python package"
# job, so maturin is not needed here. Never the vendor package. Compiled with
# pip-tools once per Python version, on that version, because the versions
# that resolve differ (numpy, pandas and pyarrow drop Python 3.10 and 3.11);
# Dependabot's pip updater recompiles each with the Python its header names:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=requirements-matrix-3.X.txt requirements-matrix.in
pyarrow>=14
polars>=1.0
pandas>=2.2
